      "message": "[error] Line 1329: 🔴 Once `onReceiveReinvite` has handed the transaction to the external endpoint, these failure returns do not send a SIP error response or otherwise clear the pending re-INVITE. A malformed/incompatible API SDP (or a failure from `pjsip_inv_set_sdp_answer`/`pjsip_inv_answer`) therefore leaves the peer waiting until timeout and can block subsequent dialog requests. On every failure, generate an appropriate non-2xx response or reset the pending transaction; only leave it pending while a valid answer can still be supplied.",
